Here is how to set up a secret password connection string using Rider:
1. Initialize User Secrets in Rider
Open your project in JetBrains Rider.
Right-click on the project in the Solution Explorer.
Select Tools -> Manage User Secrets.
This creates a secrets.json file outside your project folder and adds a <UserSecretsId> to your .csproj file. 
