2. Add the Connection String 
Add your connection string with the secret password into the secrets.json file that opens: 
json
{
  "ConnectionStrings": {
    "DefaultConnection": "Server=myServerAddress;Database=myDataBase;User Id=myUsername;Password=YOUR_SECRET_PASSWORD;"
  }
}
3. Access the Secret in Code
In your appsettings.json, you can leave the connection string empty or omit it entirely. Your application will automatically read from secrets.json during development. 
